        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fan, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fan, at plant
This dataset is a rough estimation of the material composition of a fan used in a PSU that can be found in a desktop PC.;
UUID: 8af1c811-9706-3479-ae8f-fa82c0a63ef5
This dataset contains the material inputs that build up all together a fan, used in a power supply unit of a Desktop PC. Requirements and emissions of the assembly process (energy, emissions, waste) are not included.
Location: Data used has no specific geographical origin (see Sampling Procedure).
Technology: The dataset represents the material composition of a fan, as used in PSU.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: own dismantling &amp; estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8af1c811-9706-3479-ae8f-fa82c0a63ef5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
